WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:05.779
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: No giant robots!

00:00:05.779 --> 00:00:10.210
The Foundation has been required to use some
seemingly unusual methods of containing anomalies

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.380
over the years.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:15.920
The Polymorphic Humanoid is kept in her containment
by a collection of dogs, for example.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:20.480
There have been sugar substitutes, vats of
acid, VHS players, and more.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:25.250
But one thing is certain: we will never employ
the use of giant robots, no matter how many

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.909
times Dr. Bright tells everyone to watch Pacific
Rim or any other piece of media that features

00:00:29.909 --> 00:00:30.909
them.

00:00:30.909 --> 00:00:34.320
We do not trust Dr. Bright with giant robot
technology, nor is it considered the most

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.380
efficient use of Foundation resources.

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:39.220
No, Dr. Bright, not even on your birthday.

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:40.220
Okay…

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:44.930
Except the Dragon Slayer.

